### 2.b. fs-9p (default): a reader at priority 40 next to 8 CPU-bound loops at priority 30

qnx# fs-9p -d -v -a hostshare -m /mnt/host
fs-9p 0.7.0: mount tag "hostshare" mounted at /mnt/host (9P2000.L, msize 135168, legacy interface, interrupt-driven (interrupt thread priority 21, set to the highest waiting client), 16 request slots)

